[style name="visual_novel"]
[wait time="2.0"]
[signal arg="change_frame_one"]
intro_woz: In the sand\
Under moonlight . . .
[wait time="1.0"]
intro_woz: . . . meditating . . .
[wait time="2.0"]
intro_woz: Refreshing!
[signal arg="play_corpo_box"]
[wait time="6.0"]
[signal arg="change_frame_two"]
intro_woz: !
[wait time="2.0"]
[signal arg="change_frame_one"]
(Move with the D-Pad)
[end_timeline]
